  <name>Volume Mixer</name>
  <summary>Per-application volume mixer for Ubuntu</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Volume Mixer is a native GTK 4 / libadwaita desktop app for controlling
      output, input, and per-application audio levels on Ubuntu with PipeWire
      (via the PulseAudio compatibility layer).
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Master output and microphone volume with device pickers</li>
      <li>Per-application volume sliders, mute, and output routing</li>
      <li>System tray popup for quick access</li>
      <li>Global microphone mute shortcut</li>
      <li>Optional login autostart</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
